    "detailed_description": "This game is a stand-alone game. Purchase can unlock all the content of the game itself, including all endings and achievements in the classic mode.<br />\r\nGames are word-based games that express characters, tasks, battles, collections, and more through words.<br />\r\nAll historical figures in the game can be accepted as teammates, can fight, and all imaginable characters can be challenged!<br />\r\nThe background of the game is the Three Kingdoms. Here, defeating Lu Bu and Zuo Ci to complete the God of War is not the ultimate goal.<br />\r\nOverlord can be completed, and other endings can also be completed, yes, this is a multi-ending game.<br />\r\nFor those who like to collect achievements, there are dozens of achievements waiting for you to achieve!<br />\r\nIf you like character appreciation, hundreds of characters are recruited.<br />\r\nEveryone's weapons can be dropped. Of course, if you want Fang Tianhuaji and Chitu, you still have to prepare!<br />\r\nOur game is perfect for friends who are bored and want to pass the time.",
    "about_the_game": "This game is a stand-alone game. Purchase can unlock all the content of the game itself, including all endings and achievements in the classic mode.<br />\r\nGames are word-based games that express characters, tasks, battles, collections, and more through words.<br />\r\nAll historical figures in the game can be accepted as teammates, can fight, and all imaginable characters can be challenged!<br />\r\nThe background of the game is the Three Kingdoms. Here, defeating Lu Bu and Zuo Ci to complete the God of War is not the ultimate goal.<br />\r\nOverlord can be completed, and other endings can also be completed, yes, this is a multi-ending game.<br />\r\nFor those who like to collect achievements, there are dozens of achievements waiting for you to achieve!<br />\r\nIf you like character appreciation, hundreds of characters are recruited.<br />\r\nEveryone's weapons can be dropped. Of course, if you want Fang Tianhuaji and Chitu, you still have to prepare!<br />\r\nOur game is perfect for friends who are bored and want to pass the time.",
    "short_description": "This is an open-ended text strategy simulation game with no specific route to achieve achievements or impact the ending. The direction of the game is determined by the players themselves, recruit the characters they want to recruit, and collect their favorite props.",
